 "降り掛かる": "وَقَعَ, سَقَطَ (To be moved downwards.) / سَقَطَ (To happen; to come to pass; to chance or light (upon).) / سُقُوط, هُوِيّ (The act of moving to a lower position under the effect of gravity.)  [to fall (on)] / حَدَثَ, جَرَى (To occur or take place.)  [to happen (to)]\nمثال: 途中で何かが彼の身に降りかかったに違いない。\n→ Something must have happened to him on the way.",
 "降り注ぐ": "وَابِل, مَطَر غَزِير (A heavy fall of rain.)  [to downpour]\nمثال: 雨がまともに私に降り注いでいた。\n→ The rain was falling on my face.",
 "降る": "نَزَلَ (to physically move or pass from a higher to a lower place or)  [to descend]\nمثال: 山を下ったところに学校がある。\n→ There is a school down the mountain. / [to be handed down (of an order, judgment, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は懲役十年で、女房には三年の刑が下った。\n→ He was given ten years and his wife three. / مَرَّرَ, مَرَّ (To change place.) / اِحْتَازَ (To change in state or status) / اِنْقَضَى, مَرَّ (To move through time.) / أَهمَلَ (To move through time.) / تَغَاضَى (To be accepted.) / تَخَلَّى (To refrain from doing something.) / طَريق (An opening, road, or track, available for passing; especially, one through or ov) / جَوَاز (Permission or license to pass, or to go and come.) / جَوَاز (A document granting permission to pass or to go and come; a passport; a ticket p)  [to pass (of time)] / اِسْتَسْلَمَ (To give oneself up into the power of another, especially as a prisoner; to submi) / اِسْتَسْلَام (An act of surrendering, submission into the possession of another; a feeling of )  [to surrender]",
 "降ろし": "نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [removing] / [grated vegetables, fruit, etc.] / مِبْشَرَة (a tool with which one grates, especially foods such as cheese, to facilitate get)  [grater] / [using new tools (or clothes, etc.) ; new tools (or clothes, etc.)]",
 "降ろす": "أَدْنَى, دُنْيَا (Bottom; more towards the bottom than the middle of an object.) / أَنْزَلَ (To let descend by its own weight, as something suspended; to let down.)  [to lower (a hand, flag, shutter, etc.)]\nمثال: ２階からトランクを降ろしてきてくれませんか。\n→ Can you bring down my trunk from upstairs? / [to drop off (a passenger) ; to let off]\nesp. 降ろす\nمثال: あの信号の手前で降ろしてください。\n→ Please let me off on this side of that traffic light. / سَحَبَ (To extract (money) from a bank account or other financial deposit.) / تَرَاجَعَ (Chiefly followed by from: to leave a place, someone's presence, etc., to go to a)  [to withdraw (money)]\nمثال: 銀行で１０万下ろしてください。\n→ Please draw a hundred thousand yen from the bank. / [to use for the first time ; to wear for the first time]",
 "降下": "نُزُول (An instance of descending; act of coming down.) / اَصْل (Lineage or hereditary derivation.)  [descent]\nمثال: その大型機は鋭い音を立ててほとんど直角に降下した。\n→ The giant plane screamed down in an almost vertical dive. / [passing down (of an order, decree, etc.)]",
 "降伏": "اِسْتَسْلَمَ (To give oneself up into the power of another, especially as a prisoner; to submi) / اِسْتَسْلَام (An act of surrendering, submission into the possession of another; a feeling of )  [surrender]\nمثال: 降伏するくらいなら死んだほうが増しだ。\n→ I would rather die than yield. / أَجْزَأَ (to give as required) / أَجْزَى (to give as required) / أَدَرَّ (to give as required) / أَغَلَّ (to give as required) / أَكْسَبَ (to give as required) / أَمَّنَ (to give as required) / إِفَادَة (quantity of something produced) / إِفَادَةٌ مِنْ (quantity of something produced) / إِنْتاج (quantity of something produced) / إِيراد (quantity of something produced) / اِسْتِفَادَة (quantity of something produced) / جَدَاء (quantity of something produced)  [yield]",
 "降参": "اِسْتَسْلَمَ (To give oneself up into the power of another, especially as a prisoner; to submi) / اِسْتَسْلَام (An act of surrendering, submission into the possession of another; a feeling of )  [surrender]\nمثال: 海賊達には降参する以外に道はなかった。\n→ The pirates had no choice but to surrender. / [being defeated (e.g. by a problem) ; giving up]",
 "降口": "قِمَّة (The highest or uppermost part of something.)  [top (of a flight of stairs)] / [exit door (e.g. of a bus) ; steps down (from a bus, etc.)]",
 "降板": "[leaving the mound ; being knocked out] / اِسْتِقَالَة, اِسْتِعْفَاء (The act of resigning.)  [resignation]",
 "降格圏": "مِنْطَقَة الهُبَوط (The bottom part of e.g. a sports table, listing how well teams have played over )  [relegation zone]",
 "降水": "تَسَاقُط, هُطُول (Any or all of the forms of water particles, whether liquid or solid, that fall f) / تَرَسُّب (A reaction that leads to the formation of a heavier, and often less soluble, sol) / عجلة (Unwise or rash rapidity; sudden haste.)  [precipitation]",
 "降水量": "تَسَاقُط, هُطُول (Any or all of the forms of water particles, whether liquid or solid, that fall f) / تَرَسُّب (A reaction that leads to the formation of a heavier, and often less soluble, sol) / عجلة (Unwise or rash rapidity; sudden haste.)  [precipitation]\nمثال: 今夏の降水量は普通でなかった。\n→ This summer we had an unusual amount of rain.",
 "降温": "بَارِد (Of a mildly low temperature.) / يُبَرِّد (To lose heat, to get colder.)  [cooling]",
 "降着": "هُبُوط (An arrival at a surface, as of an airplane or any descending object.) / بَسْطَة (A level area at the top of a flight of stairs, or connecting one flight with ano)  [landing] / [demotion] / تنامي (The process of separate particles aggregating or coalescing together; concretion)  [accretion]",
 "降納": "أَدْنَى, دُنْيَا (Bottom; more towards the bottom than the middle of an object.) / أَنْزَلَ (To let descend by its own weight, as something suspended; to let down.)  [lowering (e.g. of a flag)]",
 "降臨": "نُزُول (An instance of descending; act of coming down.) / اَصْل (Lineage or hereditary derivation.)  [descent (to earth, esp. of a god)] / وُصُول, وِفَادَة (The act of arriving (reaching a certain place).)  [arrival (of an important person)]",
 "降誕": "وِلَادَة, مَوْلِد (The process of childbearing; the beginning of life; the emergence of a human bab) / وِلَادَة, بدايَة (A beginning or start; a point of origin.) / وَلَدَ, وَضَعَ (To bear or give birth to (a child).)  [birth (of a saint, monarch, etc.)]",
 "降誕祭": "الْكْرِيسْمَاس, الْمِيلَاد (A festival or holiday commemorating the birth of Jesus Christ and incorporating )  [Christmas] / [celebration of the birthday of a saint or great man]",
 "降車口": "خُرُوج (action of going out or going away, or leaving — see also dep) / مَخْرَج (way out) / خَرَجَ (to go out or go away from a place or situation — see also de)  [exit (for disembarking passengers)]",
 "降雨": "مَطَر, مطر (Condensed water falling from a cloud.) / أَمْطَرَ, مَطَرَ (To have rain fall from the sky.) / أَمْطَرَ (To issue (something) in large quantities.)  [rain]\nمثال: 先週の激しい降雨のために出水した。\n→ We had flooding because of last week's heavy rains.",
 "降雨林": "غَابَة اِسْتِوَائِيَّة (A forest in a climate with high annual rainfall and no dry season.)  [rainforest]",
 "降雪": "تَسَاقُط ثُلُوج (An instance of falling of snow.)  [snowfall]\nمثال: 予報はさらに降雪があると伝えていた。\n→ The prediction was for more snow.",
 "降雹": "بَرَد, مطر تلج (Balls or pieces of ice falling as precipitation, often in connection with a thun) / السلام عليك, السلام عليكم (An exclamation of respectful or reverent salutation, or, occasionally, of famili)  [hail]",
 "降霊術": "نِكْرُومَانْسِيَّة (Divination involving the dead or death.)  [necromancy]",
 "降霜": "صَقِيع (A cover of minute ice crystals on objects that are exposed to the air. Frost is ) / صَقِيع, صَقْعَة (The cold weather that causes these ice crystals to form.)  [frost]",
 "限": "نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end] / مُتَّجِه (Ready to start or go (to); moving in the direction (of).)  [bound] / [delivery date (of a futures contract)] / خاتمة (The grand end of something, especially of a show or piece of music.)  [finale (of a noh song)]",
 "限り": "حَدّ (A restriction; a bound beyond which one may not go or proceed.) / نِهَايَة (A value to which a sequence converges. Equivalently, the common value of the upp) / حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrict; to circumscribe; not to allow to go beyond a certain bound, to set )  [limit]\nمثال: 彼の好奇心には限りがなかった。\n→ His curiosity knew no bounds. / دَرَجَة (A unit of measurement of angle equal to ¹⁄₃₆₀ of a circle's circumference.)  [degree]\nمثال: 私の力が及ぶ限り援助します。\n→ I'll help you to the best of my ability. / النِهاية (Used traditionally at the end of a story or film.)  [the end]\nمثال: アキラはお金の続く限りニューヨークに滞在するだろう。\n→ Akira will stay in New York while his money lasts. / [as long as ... ; as far as ...]\nafter an adjective, verb, or noun\nمثال: 汚さない限り、この本を持ち帰ってもいいですよ。\n→ You may take this book as long as you keep it clean.",
 "限りある": "مَحْدُود (With certain (often specified) limits placed upon it.)  [limited]\nمثال: 死によって人間の限りある人生は終わる。\n→ Death ends man's finite existence.",
 "限り有る": "مَحْدُود (With certain (often specified) limits placed upon it.)  [limited]\nمثال: 死によって人間の限りある人生は終わる。\n→ Death ends man's finite existence.",
 "限る": "حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrain within boundaries; to limit; to confine)  [to restrict]\nمثال: 金持ちが必ずしも幸福とは限らない。\n→ The rich are not always happy. / [to be restricted to ; to be limited to] / [to be best (for) ; to be the best plan]\nas ...は...に限る\nمثال: 暑い日は冷たいビールに限る。\n→ There is nothing like cold beer on a hot day.",
 "限制": "تَقْيِيد, اِقْتِصَار (The act of restricting, or the state of being restricted.) / قَيْد (A regulation or limitation that restricts.)  [restriction]",
 "限外顕微鏡": "مجهر فوقي (a microscope that uses bright illumination against a black background to view sm)  [ultramicroscope]",
 "限定": "حَدّ (A restriction; a bound beyond which one may not go or proceed.) / نِهَايَة (A value to which a sequence converges. Equivalently, the common value of the upp) / حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrict; to circumscribe; not to allow to go beyond a certain bound, to set )  [limit]\nمثال: 切符の数は限定されていた。\n→ The number of tickets was limited.",
 "限定子": "مُقَيِّدٌ (A word or phrase, such as an adjective or adverb, that describes or characterize)  [qualifier]",
 "限定用法": "تَقْيِيدِيّ (Confining, limiting, containing within defined bounds.)  [restrictive (use)]\nمثال: 不定詞の形容詞的用法には２種類あり、（１）限定用法、（２）叙述用法。（２）はもちろん主格補語です。\n→ There are two ways of using the infinitive as an adjective, 1. attributive, 2. predicative. Naturally 2. is a subject complement.",
 "限定的": "مَحْدُود (With certain (often specified) limits placed upon it.)  [limited]\nمثال: 最近ドル先安感が強まっているなかで、為替相場は米経済指標に対する反応はかなり限定的である。\n→ As expectation increases that the dollar will weaken, the foreign exchange market's reaction to US economic indicators has been fairly…",
 "限定詞": "مُحَدِّدَة (A member of a class of words functioning in a noun phrase to identify or disting)  [determiner]",
 "限局": "تَقْيِيد, اِقْتِصَار (The act of restricting, or the state of being restricted.) / قَيْد (A regulation or limitation that restricts.)  [restriction]",
 "限度": "حَدّ (A restriction; a bound beyond which one may not go or proceed.) / نِهَايَة (A value to which a sequence converges. Equivalently, the common value of the upp) / حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrict; to circumscribe; not to allow to go beyond a certain bound, to set )  [limit]\nمثال: 物事には限度がある。\n→ There is a limit to everything.",
 "限度枠": "مُتَّجِه (Ready to start or go (to); moving in the direction (of).)  [bound]",
 "限度額": "حَدّ (A restriction; a bound beyond which one may not go or proceed.) / نِهَايَة (A value to which a sequence converges. Equivalently, the common value of the upp) / حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrict; to circumscribe; not to allow to go beyond a certain bound, to set )  [limit (amount, e.g. on credit card, loan, expenditure)]",
 "限界": "حَدّ (A restriction; a bound beyond which one may not go or proceed.) / نِهَايَة (A value to which a sequence converges. Equivalently, the common value of the upp) / حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrict; to circumscribe; not to allow to go beyond a certain bound, to set )  [limit]\nمثال: あらゆるものに限界がある。\n→ There is a limit to everything.",
 "限界点": "عَتَبَة (The lowermost part of a doorway that one crosses to enter; a sill.) / بِدَايَة (The outset of something; the point of entry, or the beginning of an action.)  [threshold]",
 "限量子": "مُحَدِدْ الْكَمِيَّةْ (A word, such as all or many, that expresses the quantity of a related noun.)  [quantifier]",
 "陛下": "جَلَالَتُكَ, جَلَالَتُكِ (A term of address used in direct address to a monarch of higher rank than a prin)  [Your Majesty]",
 "陞任": "تَرْقِيَة, تَرْفِيع (An advancement in rank or position.) / تَرْوِيج (Dissemination of information in order to increase its popularity.) / تَرْقِيَة (Transformation of a pawn into a piece (by reaching the opponent's back rank).)  [promotion]\nمثال: 君は次の昇任予定者です。\n→ You are the next in line for promotion.",
