 "陣陣": "[each encampment] / قَوِيّ (Capable of producing great physical force.) / مَنِيع, مَتِيْن (Capable of withstanding great physical force.) / قَوِيّ, راسِخ (Determined; unyielding.) / شَدِيْد, قَوْيّ (Highly stimulating to the senses.) / شَدِيْد (Having an offensive or intense odor or flavor.) / حَادّ, ثَقِيْل (Having a high concentration of an essential or active ingredient.) / بِقُوَّة (In a strong manner.)  [strong (wind)] / مُتَقَطِّع (Stopping and starting, occurring, or presenting at intervals; coming after a par) / مَوْسِمِيّ (Existing only for certain seasons; that is, being dry for part of the year.)  [intermittent]",
 "陣風": "هَبَّة (A strong, abrupt rush of wind.)  [gust]",
 "除": "تَقْسِيم (The act or process of dividing anything.) / قِسْمَة (The process of dividing a number by another.) / قِسْمَةٌ (A calculation that involves this process.) / فِرْقَة (A formation, usually made up of two or three brigades.) / فُرْقَة (A disagreement; a difference of viewpoint between two sides of an argument.)  [division]",
 "除いて": "اِسْتَثْنَى (To exclude; to specify as being an exception.) / إِلَّا, بِاسْتِثْنَاء (Used to introduce an exception or qualification to something previously stated.) / إِلَّا (Used to introduce a clause, phrase, verb infinitive, adverb or other non-noun co)  [except]\nusu. as ...を除いて\nمثال: 一人を除いて全員が彼の計画に賛成した。\n→ All except one agreed to his plan.",
 "除き去る": "نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [to remove]",
 "除く": "نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [to remove]\nمثال: 医者は彼の苦痛を除いてやった。\n→ The doctor released him from his pain. / اِسْتَثْنَى (To exclude; to specify as being an exception.) / إِلَّا, بِاسْتِثْنَاء (Used to introduce an exception or qualification to something previously stated.) / إِلَّا (Used to introduce a clause, phrase, verb infinitive, adverb or other non-noun co)  [to except]\nمثال: 発音の点を除けば、みんな上手なフランス語を話す。\n→ Except for pronunciation, everyone can speak good French. / قَتَلَ, قتل (To put to death; to extinguish the life of.) / قَتْلَة (The act of killing.)  [to kill (a traitor, opponent, etc.)]",
 "除け": "حِمَايَة (The process of keeping (something or someone) safe.)  [protection]",
 "除ける": "[to put something out of the way ; to move (something, someone) aside] / نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [to remove] / [to set aside ; to keep apart] / [to remove (someone) from the group ; to shun]",
 "除け者": "مَنْبُوذ, مَنْبُوذَة (One that has been excluded from a society or a system, a pariah, a leper.)  [outcast]",
 "除け者にする": "تَجَاهَلَ, طَنَّش (To deliberately not listen or pay attention to.)  [to ignore]\nمثال: みんなが私をのけ者にしたの。\n→ I was left out in the cold by everyone.",
 "除する": "قَسَّمَ (To separate into two or more parts.) / قَسَّمَ (To calculate the quotient number by which another one (the divisor) is multiplie)  [to divide (by)] / نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [to remove]",
