 "雛鳥": "صُوص, فَرُّوج (A young bird.) / فَتَاة (An attractive, young woman; or, more generally, a woman.)  [chick]\nمثال: 公園を歩いているとき、私はひな鳥を見つけた。\n→ Walking in the park, I found a baby bird.",
 "離す": "فَصَلَ (To disunite from a group or mass; to disconnect.) / مُنْفَصِل (Apart from (the rest); not connected to or attached to (anything else).)  [to separate]\nمثال: すみません。いま手が離せないんです。\n→ I'm sorry, I'm busy right now.",
