 "離別": "تَفْرِقَة (The act of disuniting two or more things, or the condition of being separated.)  [separation]\nمثال: 結婚している人々の間では、離婚や離別が増え、その結果、片親の家庭がますます多くなっている。\n→ Among married couples, there has been an increase in divorce and separation with the result that there are many more one-parent families.",
 "離反": "فِرَار, هَجْر (The act of deserting.)  [desertion] / مَخَاضَة (A vessel used for churning, especially for producing butter.)  [(customer) churn]",
 "離婚": "طَلَاق, تَطْلِيق (The legal dissolution of a marriage.) / طَلَّقَ (To legally dissolve a marriage between two people.) / أَطْلَقَ (To end one's own marriage to (a person) in this way.)  [divorce]\nمثال: 私は離婚に同意するつもりだ。\n→ I will consent to the divorce.",
