 "青銅": "بُرُنْزٌ, فِلِزّ (A naturally occurring or man-made alloy of copper, usually in combination with t) / بُرُنْزِيٌّ (A reddish-brown colour, the colour of bronze.)  [bronze]\nمثال: 彼らは青銅で像を鋳造した。\n→ They cast bronze into a statue.",
