 "青鯖": "إِسْقُمَرِيّ (edible fish) / مَاكْرِيل (edible fish)  [mackerel (esp. the chub mackerel, Scomber japonicus)]",
 "青鹿毛": "بُنِّيّ (colour) / أَسْمَر (colour) / أَسْمَر, سَمْرَاء (Having a brown color/colour.)  [brown (horse coat color)]",
