 "静か": "صَامِت, هَادِئ (With little or no sound; free of disturbing noise.)  [quiet]\nمثال: キャプテンは静かにするように命じた。\n→ The captain commanded silence. / بَطِيء (Taking a long time to move or go a short distance, or to perform an action; not ) / أَبْطَأَ, بَطَّأَ (To make (something) run, move, etc. less quickly; to reduce the speed of.)  [slow] / هَادِئ (Peaceful, quiet, especially free from anger and anxiety.) / طَمْأَنَ (To make calm.)  [calm]",
 "静かに": "بِهُدُوء (Producing little or no noise.)  [quietly]\nمثال: 静かに、子供たちが眠っています。\n→ Be quiet. The kids are asleep. / [be quiet!]\nمثال: 静かに、授業中にしゃべってはいけません。\n→ Be quiet. Don't talk in class.",
 "静けさ": "صَمْت, سُكُوت (The absence of any sound.) / صَمَّتَ (To make (someone or something) silent.) / صَمْتًا!, صَهٍ! (Be silent.)  [silence]\nمثال: 私の望むのは安らぎと静けさだけです。\n→ All I want is peace and quiet.",
 "静けし": "صَامِت, هَادِئ (With little or no sound; free of disturbing noise.)  [quiet]",
 "静まる": "هَدَأَ (To become quieter.)  [to quiet down]\nesp. 静まる\nمثال: シンと静まった部室。響くのは、クロッキー帳に擦れる鉛筆の音だけ。\n→ The club room returned to quiet. All that could be heard was the sound of pencil on sketchpad. / أَهْدَأَ, هَدَّأَ (To become less excited, intense, or angry.) / أَهْدَأَ, هَدَّأَ (To cause to become less excited, intense, or angry.)  [to calm down]\nesp. 鎮まる\nمثال: 海をじっと眺めていると私は気が静まる感じがする。\n→ When I contemplate the sea, I feel calm.",
 "静める": "صَامِت, هَادِئ (With little or no sound; free of disturbing noise.)  [to quiet (a child, crowd, etc.)] / هَادِئ (Peaceful, quiet, especially free from anger and anxiety.) / طَمْأَنَ (To make calm.)  [to calm (one's nerves, excitement, etc.)]\nمثال: 心を静めるために私は目を閉じた。\n→ I closed my eyes to calm down. / [to suppress (a rebellion, riot, fire, etc.) ; to quell]\nesp. 鎮める\nمثال: 暴動はすぐに鎮められた。\n→ The rebellion was soon put down. / سَكَّنَ (To ease or relieve pain or suffering.)  [to soothe]\nesp. 鎮める",
 "静寂": "صَمْت, سُكُوت (The absence of any sound.) / صَمَّتَ (To make (someone or something) silent.) / صَمْتًا!, صَهٍ! (Be silent.)  [silence]\nمثال: その幻は意識の中に宿り、静寂のなかで動かない。\n→ The vision that was planted in my senses still silently lingers.",
 "静寧": "سَلَام, هُدُوء (A state of tranquility, quiet, and harmony. For instance, a state free from civi) / سَلَام (Harmony in personal relations.)  [peace]",
