 "飛び翔る": "ذُبَابَة, دبان (Especially, any of the insects of the family Muscidae, such as the common housef) / طَارَ (to travel through air) / طار (to travel through air)  [to fly]",
 "飛び蝗虫": "جَرَادَة (type of grasshopper)  [(swarming) locusts]",
 "飛び越える": "شَفَّاف (Transparent in colour.) / وَاضِح (Free of ambiguity or doubt; easily understood.)  [to clear]\nمثال: 犬は囲いを跳び越えて庭に入ってきた。\n→ The dog jumped over the fence into the garden. / [to fly over ; to fly across]\nمثال: ボールははずんで塀を飛び越えた。\n→ The ball bounced over the wall. / [to jump ahead (of someone) ; to skip over]",
 "飛び越し": "قَفَزَ (To propel oneself rapidly upward, downward and/or in any horizontal direction su) / قَفْزَة (An instance of propelling oneself upwards.)  [jump]",
 "飛び跳ねる": "نَقْز (A short jump.) / نَقَزَ (To jump a short distance.)  [to hop]\nمثال: 猫は鳥めがけて飛び跳ねた。\n→ The cat sprang at the bird.",
 "飛び込み": "قَفَزَ (To propel oneself rapidly upward, downward and/or in any horizontal direction su) / قَفْزَة (An instance of propelling oneself upwards.)  [jump] / [appearing without an appointment ; bursting in]"
}
